64
00:03:29,175 --> 00:03:32,824
The combination of the credit received from selling the call side and

65
00:03:32,824 --> 00:03:36,169
the put side is going to give us a net credit.

66
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:39,400
That is how much credit is being received to open this trade.

67
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:44,100
The max loss is how much margin is required to open this trade.

68
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:48,240
Your max profit is going to be the max amount of credit you received.

69
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:52,760
